            "kicker_tag": "div",
            "title": "Mike Gadsby, Chief Innovation Officer",
            "heading_level": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "div",
            "add_description": true,
            "description": "As the co-founder of O3, Mike is a leading expert in artificial intelligence, customer experience, and user experience strategy. With nearly 20 years of innovation at O3, Mike has helped businesses across sectors grow by applying design thinking and technology solutions that drive meaningful impact. He also leads O3's Labs program, where hands-on workshops and rapid experimentation fuel product innovation and business transformation. Speaking topics include the latest in AI and innovation, and the intersection of AI and CX for an executive level audience."
          },
