        "acfe_flexible_layout_title": "Text and Accordion",
        "content": [
          {
            "acf_fc_layout": "title",
            "kicker": "SPEAKING CAPABILITIES",
            "kicker_tag": "div",
            "title": "Recent events",
            "heading_level": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "div",
            "add_description": true,
            "description": "Mike delivers lunch + learns, panels, keynotes, podcasts, and workshops for diverse industries and audiences. Here are some recent highlights:"
          }
        ],
        "accordion": [
          {
            "panel_title": "“AI for the C-Suite” podcast",
            "panel_text": "<p>Mike recently joined the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rHw5fp_19C0\">&#8220;AI for the C-Suite™&#8221;</a> podcast to discuss how AI is reshaping digital strategy, user experience, and client relationships across industries.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Lunch and learn with 6abc WPVI-TV Philadelphia",
            "panel_text": "<p>Mike presented valuable perspectives on AI tailored to the 6abc WPVI-TV Philadelphia’s team. The lunch and learn session aimed to demystify the complex world of AI and CX, exploring the evolving roles in shaping marketing and content development in news and journalism.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Keynote speaker at the 1682 conference",
            "panel_text": "<p>Mike delivered a keynote titled <a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/1682-conference-recap-unveiling-ais-realities-and-innovation-insights/\">“AI unveiled: Five hard truths”</a> offering unfiltered insights based on years of experimentation and strategic work with clients across sectors.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "AI in education: Beyond School Hours Conference",
            "panel_text": "<p>As the event’s official AI sponsor, <a href=\"https://www.edweek.org/events/webinar/ai-and-educational-leadership-driving-innovation-and-equity\">Mike shared AI thought leadership</a>, exploring how technology is reshaping the future of learning.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "AI’s impact on creativity: Panel hosted by Philly Ad Club",
            "panel_text": "<p>The panel <a href=\"https://www.phillyadclub.com/event-calendar/#!event/2024/4/12/impact-and-innovation-ai-creativity\">explored how AI is transforming the creative process</a> and empowering creators as collaborators rather than replacements.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Podcast: Is AI a superhero or a villain?",
            "panel_text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/is-ai-a-superhero-or-a-villain-mike-gadsby-explores-on-the-penji-podcast/\">In a podcast hosted by Penji</a>, Mike explored various aspects of AI, examining its future, applications in customer experiences, and the challenges it poses to businesses.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "ADPList’s AI Summit",
            "panel_text": "<p>Mike represented O3 at <a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/ai-inside-out-enhancing-products-process-at-adplists-ai-summit/\">ADPList’s inaugural AI Summit</a>, sharing insights on integrating AI into products alongside industry leaders from Microsoft and J.P. Morgan.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "WIPA conference keynote “AI at Your Service” ",
            "panel_text": "<p>Mike hosted a <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7265025007330770945\">keynote session at WIPA’s “AI at Your Service”</a> event. He shared how AI enhances customer experiences, streamlines event operations, and empowers teams to focus on human connections.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Defining innovation panel ",
            "panel_text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/defining-innovation-with-cliff-kuang-3-important-takeaways/\">On a discussion with Kuang</a>, Mike explored how technology can lead to better outcomes for businesses, but it requires effective leadership to advocate for innovation and put processes in place to ensure utilization correctly.</p>\n"
          }
        ]
      },
