            "heading_level": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "div",
            "add_description": true,
            "description": "Here's what others say about Mike's speaking engagements:"
          }
        ],
        "text_editor": "<h4>I really enjoyed your keynote on AI and its potential for product innovation. It was super insightful and got me thinking!</h4>\n<p>—Product Designer, Accenture</p>\n<h4>I highly enjoyed your team&#8217;s presentation — very hands-on and applicable. Thank you for sharing your knowledge and experience with us.</h4>\n<p>—Founder, Design Studio</p>\n<h4>“Discussions were focused on diving deep into the transformative power of AI and innovation. It’s inspiring to see how businesses are leveraging these technologies to drive growth and solve problems.”</h4>\n<p>—Lindsay Hamlin, Senior Director of Transformation, Best Egg</p>\n"
      }
